$NetBSD$

Select the native V4L2 ABI for stateful M2M codecs.
Probe codec formats in the same native header used by the implementation.
Keep the Linux header path on Linux. Do not provide missing kernel APIs.
Initialize the reference semaphore once before probing devices.
Check sem_init failure. Destroy only a successfully initialized semaphore.
The previous no-device unwind dereferenced an uninitialized NetBSD sem_t.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted). Not submitted upstream.

